@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor black
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor black
}
actor "前台" as A0
boundary "<u>:前台接口</u>" as B0
control "<u>:登记到诊控制</u>" as K
participant "<u>:患者</u>" as Patient
participant "<u>:预约</u>" as Appointment
participant "<u>:日期安排</u>" as Schedule
participant "<u>:接诊占用</u>" as Occupancy
participant "<u>:就诊</u>" as Visit
participant "<u>:病历</u>" as Record
A0 -> B0 : 提交UC-03办理依据
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 协调UC-03办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
K -> Patient : 核对身份(到诊患者)
activate Patient
Patient --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Patient
opt 到诊有预约来源
K -> Appointment : 核对到诊来源(预约编号或现场来源)
activate Appointment
Appointment --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Appointment
end
K -> Schedule : 确认到诊占用(既有占用或现场时段)
activate Schedule
Schedule -> Occupancy : 关联到诊(患者、牙医、诊椅)
activate Occupancy
Occupancy --> Schedule : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Occupancy
Schedule --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Schedule
K -> Visit : 登记到诊(患者、来源、占用)
activate Visit
Visit -> Record : 建立当次草稿(就诊依据)
activate Record
Record --> Visit : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Record
Visit --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Visit
opt 到诊有预约来源
K -> Appointment : 关联到诊结果(已创建的同患者就诊)
activate Appointment
Appointment --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Appointment
end
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
note over K,Record
校验不通过时返回规约中的原因；
本阶段不留下部分有效结果。
end note

@enduml
